# The three files the user owns are shipped byte for byte.
#
# Without this, git's autocrlf conversion rewrites their line endings on a
# checkout: a fresh clone of this bundle on a Windows host turns them into CRLF
# and the bundle no longer carries the user's text verbatim. Marking them
# -text tells git to store the bytes as they are and restore them as they are.
prompt-overlay.md           -text
swarm-prompt.md             -text
skills/swarm-engineering.md -text
